#: mandrakecrm.php:217
msgid "A cookie and a copy of its expiry date in local storage. They remember that you already signed up in the sign-up window or with the WhatsApp button, so you are not asked again. They last about 10 years."
msgstr "A cookie and a copy of its expiry date in local storage. They remember that you already signed up in the sign-up window or with the WhatsApp button, so you are not asked again. They last about 10 years."

#: mandrakecrm.php:221
msgid "Local storage with the email, name and WhatsApp number you entered in the sign-up window or with the WhatsApp button, to fill them in for you next time. They stay in your browser until you delete this site's data."
msgstr "Local storage with the email, name and WhatsApp number you entered in the sign-up window or with the WhatsApp button, to fill them in for you next time. They stay in your browser until you delete this site's data."

#: mandrakecrm.php:225
msgid "Local storage with the signed receipt MandrakeCRM returns when you sign up and the link to your preferences page: only with that receipt does MandrakeCRM tell this browser whether your email is already subscribed. They stay until you delete this site's data."
msgstr "Local storage with the signed receipt MandrakeCRM returns when you sign up and the link to your preferences page: only with that receipt does MandrakeCRM tell this browser whether your email is already subscribed. They stay until you delete this site's data."

#: mandrakecrm.php:229
msgid "Local storage without personal data: where you left the tab of the sign-up window and when the chat messages were shown to you, so they are not shown too often. They stay until you delete this site's data."
msgstr "Local storage without personal data: where you left the tab of the sign-up window and when the chat messages were shown to you, so they are not shown too often. They stay until you delete this site's data."

#: mandrakecrm.php:233
msgid "A cookie set only if you turn the chat sounds off or on: it remembers that choice for 1 year."
msgstr "A cookie set only if you turn the chat sounds off or on: it remembers that choice for 1 year."

#: mandrakecrm.php:241
msgid "Session storage, deleted when you close the tab: the state of the chat and of the WhatsApp greeting in that tab (with a short code derived from your account if you are logged in) and, only for the store's team, the chat preview link."
msgstr "Session storage, deleted when you close the tab: the state of the chat and of the WhatsApp greeting in that tab (with a short code derived from your account if you are logged in) and, only for the store's team, the chat preview link."

#: mandrakecrm.php:245
msgid "Storage of the chat window, which runs on chat.mandrakecrm.io inside this site's pages: the conversation and a code that recognizes this browser in the chat for 30 days (local storage), and how the chat looks and the message you have not sent yet (session storage, deleted with the tab). A new conversation starts after 24 hours without messages; ending the conversation in the chat deletes them."
msgstr "Storage of the chat window, which runs on chat.mandrakecrm.io inside this site's pages: the conversation and a code that recognizes this browser in the chat for 30 days (local storage), and how the chat looks and the message you have not sent yet (session storage, deleted with the tab). A new conversation starts after 24 hours without messages; ending the conversation in the chat deletes them."

#: mandrakecrm.php:261
msgid "MandrakeCRM sends the store's marketing emails, WhatsApp messages and abandoned cart reminders. Suggested text for the cookies and the browser storage of its plugin, and for what the MandrakeCRM widget (sign-up window, WhatsApp button, chat, product offer at checkout and cashback balance) sends and keeps in the browser:"
msgstr "MandrakeCRM sends the store's marketing emails, WhatsApp messages and abandoned cart reminders. Suggested text for the cookies and the browser storage of its plugin, and for what the MandrakeCRM widget (sign-up window, WhatsApp button, chat, product offer at checkout and cashback balance) sends and keeps in the browser:"

#: mandrakecrm.php:262
msgid "This store uses MandrakeCRM for its marketing emails, WhatsApp messages and abandoned cart reminders. These cookies of this site (first-party) may be set in your browser:"
msgstr "This store uses MandrakeCRM for its marketing emails, WhatsApp messages and abandoned cart reminders. These cookies of this site (first-party) may be set in your browser:"

#. translators: %s: coupon code
#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-coupon-link.php:872
#, php-format
msgid "Your coupon %s will be applied when you add a product to your cart."
msgstr "Your coupon %s will be applied when you add a product to your cart."

#. translators: %s: coupon code
#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-coupon-link.php:876
#, php-format
msgid "Your coupon %s will be applied at checkout as soon as you enter your email."
msgstr "Your coupon %s will be applied at checkout as soon as you enter your email."

#: mandrakecrm.php:213
msgid "A cookie and a copy of its expiry date in local storage (some browsers delete cookies written by scripts after 7 days). They remember that you closed the sign-up window, so it does not open again by itself for the period the store chose. With the previous version of the sign-up window, the cookie lasts 3,600 days (about 10 years) and has no copy in local storage."
msgstr "A cookie and a copy of its expiry date in local storage (some browsers delete cookies written by scripts after 7 days). They remember that you closed the sign-up window, so it does not open again by itself for the period the store chose. With the previous version of the sign-up window, the cookie lasts 3,600 days (about 10 years) and has no copy in local storage."

#: mandrakecrm.php:265
msgid "The sign-up window, the WhatsApp button and the chat on this site are a MandrakeCRM widget: their code is loaded from MandrakeCRM's servers (cdn.mandrakecrm.io, and the chat window from chat.mandrakecrm.io), and what you enter in them (name, email, WhatsApp number, chat messages) is sent to MandrakeCRM, which processes it for this store. When you write in the chat, it also sends the email you left in the sign-up window, the page you are viewing and the products in your cart and, if you are logged in to your account on this store, your customer number and the email of that account, so that you are recognized."
msgstr "The sign-up window, the WhatsApp button and the chat on this site are a MandrakeCRM widget: their code is loaded from MandrakeCRM's servers (cdn.mandrakecrm.io, and the chat window from chat.mandrakecrm.io), and what you enter in them (name, email, WhatsApp number, chat messages) is sent to MandrakeCRM, which processes it for this store. When you write in the chat, it also sends the email you left in the sign-up window, the page you are viewing and the products in your cart and, if you are logged in to your account on this store, your customer number and the email of that account, so that you are recognized."

#: mandrakecrm.php:269
msgid "Some parts load code from other providers, which receive your IP address and your browser's details when they deliver it: the chat loads Cloudflare Turnstile (challenges.cloudflare.com), a check against abuse, when you send your first message; and the previous version of the WhatsApp button loads its phone number field and its QR code from jsDelivr (cdn.jsdelivr.net) when you open it."
msgstr "Some parts load code from other providers, which receive your IP address and your browser's details when they deliver it: the chat loads Cloudflare Turnstile (challenges.cloudflare.com), a check against abuse, when you send your first message; and the previous version of the WhatsApp button loads its phone number field and its QR code from jsDelivr (cdn.jsdelivr.net) when you open it."

#: mandrakecrm.php:270
msgid "The widget keeps these items in your browser. They are data of this site (first-party), except those of the chat window, which are kept by chat.mandrakecrm.io, MandrakeCRM's chat domain:"
msgstr "The widget keeps these items in your browser. They are data of this site (first-party), except those of the chat window, which are kept by chat.mandrakecrm.io, MandrakeCRM's chat domain:"

#: mandrakecrm.php:264
msgid "Keep the following only if the store shows on its pages the MandrakeCRM sign-up window, WhatsApp button, chat, product offer at checkout or cashback balance."
msgstr "Keep the following only if the store shows on its pages the MandrakeCRM sign-up window, WhatsApp button, chat, product offer at checkout or cashback balance."

#: mandrakecrm.php:266
msgid "On the checkout, the product offer of the MandrakeCRM widget (order bump) sends MandrakeCRM the products in your cart, to choose what to offer, together with the email of the checkout form (the one you type or, if you are logged in, the one already filled in), every time the checkout updates and even if you do not use the offer; if you add the offered product, it also sends that product, its quantity and its value with that email, so the store knows whether the offer led to your order."
msgstr "On the checkout, the product offer of the MandrakeCRM widget (order bump) sends MandrakeCRM the products in your cart, to choose what to offer, together with the email of the checkout form (the one you type or, if you are logged in, the one already filled in), every time the checkout updates and even if you do not use the offer; if you add the offered product, it also sends that product, its quantity and its value with that email, so the store knows whether the offer led to your order."

#: mandrakecrm.php:267
msgid "When you are logged in, the MandrakeCRM cashback balance in \"My account\" sends MandrakeCRM your customer number and the email of your account, signed by this store, to show your balance and movements and, if you ask for it, to turn your balance into a coupon."
msgstr "When you are logged in, the MandrakeCRM cashback balance in \"My account\" sends MandrakeCRM your customer number and the email of your account, signed by this store, to show your balance and movements and, if you ask for it, to turn your balance into a coupon."
